source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A character reference is a safe spelling of a backslash anywhere, though the renderer only uses it where a bare backslash would be consumed.
